00:04:37.243 --> 00:04:41.413
That's a message that we're very
passionate about is, you know,

00:04:41.413 --> 00:04:44.650
you need to be able to --
[ Laughter ]

00:04:44.650 --> 00:04:47.520
She's sitting on him.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:50.689
That's fine. That's all good.
That's all good.

00:04:50.689 --> 00:04:53.059
There you go. All good.
Just stay nice and still.

00:04:53.059 --> 00:04:54.627
She just wants to see your face.

00:04:54.627 --> 00:04:55.962
See how you're going.
There you go.

00:04:55.962 --> 00:05:00.432
-Oh, my gosh.
[ Laughter ]

00:05:00.432 --> 00:05:03.168
I think it's cute. Thank you.
That's a great toy.

00:05:03.168 --> 00:05:05.371
I think it's really nice.
I like this.

00:05:05.371 --> 00:05:07.773
Do you want another --
do you want a grape?

00:05:07.773 --> 00:05:08.941
-Yeah, grab a grape.

00:05:08.941 --> 00:05:10.442
-Do you want a green grape?

00:05:10.442 --> 00:05:13.246
-I think she's out. She's done.
What do you reckon?

00:05:13.246 --> 00:05:15.247
Now, yeah, they don't make
good pets.

00:05:15.247 --> 00:05:17.950
They're better either
in the wild or being cared for

00:05:17.950 --> 00:05:20.619
